## 🪝 The Complete React Hooks Reference Table

Here is every hook in the official React specification and its designated phase:

| Hook Name | Category | Primary Purpose | Phase |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :---: |
| **`useState`** | State | Component memory / local state | **Part 1 (50%)** |
| **`useRef`** | Ref | DOM element references & mutable values without re-renders | **Part 1 (50%)** |
| **`useEffect`** | Effect | Side effects, subscriptions, API calls, timers | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`useReducer`** | State | Complex state transitions with actions & dispatch | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`useContext`** | Context | Consuming global context without prop drilling | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`useMemo`** | Performance | Caching expensive calculation outputs | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`useCallback`** | Performance | Caching function references between renders | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`useLayoutEffect`** | Effect | Synchronous DOM measurements before screen repaint | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`useId`** | Accessibility | Generating unique, accessible IDs for form fields | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`useTransition`** | Concurrent | Non-blocking background state transitions | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`useDeferredValue`** | Concurrent | Deferring re-renders for heavy UI elements | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`useImperativeHandle`** | Ref | Exposing custom methods from a child component ref | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`useInsertionEffect`** | Effect | Injecting styles before DOM mutations (CSS-in-JS) | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`useSyncExternalStore`** | Store | Safe subscription to third-party external data stores | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`useDebugValue`** | Debugging | Custom labels in React DevTools for custom hooks | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`useOptimistic`** *(v19)* | Action | Instant optimistic UI updates during async mutations | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`useActionState`** *(v19)* | Action | Handling form action state, errors, and pending flags | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`useFormStatus`** *(v19)* | Action | Checking submission status of a parent `<form>` | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`use` API** *(v19)* | Async/Context | Reading Promises and Context dynamically inside conditionals | **Part 2 (50%)** |
| **`Custom Hooks`** (`use...`) | Custom / Reusable | Extracting & sharing stateful component logic (e.g. `useFetch`, `useDebounce`) | **Part 2 (50%)** |
